    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before the cut, the Duwamish called the waterway “Carry a Canoe” (Lushootseed: sxWátSadweehL), reflecting centuries of canoe portage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
